{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 202704,
      "title": "句",
      "content": [
        "但看青玉五枝灯，蟠螭火尽光欲然。"
      ],
      "author": {
        "id": 2684,
        "name": "李颀"
      },
      "dynasty": {
        "id": 6,
        "name": "唐"
      },
